+  <name>DeepSeek Harness</name>
+  <summary>Open-source agent harness workspace</summary>
+  <description>
+    <p>
+      DeepSeek Harness is an open-source agent harness built on an
+      everything-is-a-plugin architecture. It provides a complete workspace
+      for running, composing, and managing AI agents, with a bundled runtime
+      for Node.js, pnpm, Python, and the LibreOffice conversion engine.
+    </p>
+    <p>
+      The Linux build is self-contained: Electron, the dsh runtime, and the
+      WASM engines for image and document processing are all bundled, so the
+      application runs without system dependencies beyond glibc and a display
+      server.
+    </p>
